    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/59e4dd88bf477860f03f6ed46510808f.avif?t=1727786544\" /></div><br><br>Do you think you have a good aim? Prove it in AIMTROPOLIS, an arcade shooter for VR where you\u2019ll have to beat a series of minigames in random order that will change in every game depending on the difficulty you choose. Get the highest score in all the minigames and rise until you reach number 1!<br><br>Precision and speed will be the key to getting a good score, so pay attention to the rules of each minigame! Every time you finish one, your score will get registered in the national and worldwide rankings, and you\u2019ll be able to measure your skill up against people around the world! Will you be able to crown yourself?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/30c196d461d0e72eae1740756e7e984e.poster.avif?t=1727786544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/30c196d461d0e72eae1740756e7e984e.webm?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/30c196d461d0e72eae1740756e7e984e.mp4?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/e660ff3acbf78bfc7b0dfe3c1cc76557.avif?t=1727786544\" /></div><br><br>In each game of AIMTROPOLIS you\u2019ll have to beat 8 minigames set in 5 different worlds that will occur in random order, and will be determined by the difficulty level you choose. At launch, the game will have 20 minigames, and will receive free updates each month until November of 2023, when it\u2019ll reach 50 minigames in total.<br><br>The 5 worlds inside the game are unique and in each of them you\u2019ll find a totally different setting with its own unique soundtrack. Put yourself in the shoes of a sheriff in the wild West, face off against pirates in the Caribbean, or travel through time and visit the Middle Ages or a futuristic world of science fiction.<br><br>The number of minigames, worlds and difficulty levels will make it so that no game of AIMTROPOLIS is the same as the previous. Let the minigames begin!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7ae38482a6fca95638a2756c44ba1be5.poster.avif?t=1727786544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7ae38482a6fca95638a2756c44ba1be5.webm?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7ae38482a6fca95638a2756c44ba1be5.mp4?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7edd34890af8596d439dfbc291789b21.avif?t=1727786544\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 minigames; 20 at launch and 5 new ones every month from July to November of 2023.<br></li><li>8 minigames per game.  <br></li><li>5 worlds with unique settings. <br></li><li>4 difficulty levels to choose from. <br></li><li>National and worldwide rankings.<br></li><li>Soundtrack created and designed specifically for each world of the game.<br></li><li>Skins, achievements and bonus levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/1fe9b0fdd635b1a8bb133a01e395a0d4.poster.avif?t=1727786544\" ><source sr