ames in total.<br><br>The 5 worlds inside the game are unique and in each of them you\u2019ll find a totally different setting with its own unique soundtrack. Put yourself in the shoes of a sheriff in the wild West, face off against pirates in the Caribbean, or travel through time and visit the Middle Ages or a futuristic world of science fiction.<br><br>The number of minigames, worlds and difficulty levels will make it so that no game of AIMTROPOLIS is the same as the previous. Let the minigames begin!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7ae38482a6fca95638a2756c44ba1be5.poster.avif?t=1727786544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7ae38482a6fca95638a2756c44ba1be5.webm?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7ae38482a6fca95638a2756c44ba1be5.mp4?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/7edd34890af8596d439dfbc291789b21.avif?t=1727786544\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 minigames; 20 at launch and 5 new ones every month from July to November of 2023.<br></li><li>8 minigames per game.  <br></li><li>5 worlds with unique settings. <br></li><li>4 difficulty levels to choose from. <br></li><li>National and worldwide rankings.<br></li><li>Soundtrack created and designed specifically for each world of the game.<br></li><li>Skins, achievements and bonus levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/1fe9b0fdd635b1a8bb133a01e395a0d4.poster.avif?t=1727786544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/1fe9b0fdd635b1a8bb133a01e395a0d4.webm?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147360/extras/1fe9b0fdd635b1a8bb133a01e395a0d4.mp4?t=1727786544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
